Z||000001||Oreif||08-26-2000||12:55 AM||||Ignition Module in distributor.<BR>Ignition Coil.<BR>Bad Injector. (stuck open?)<BR>Bad head gasket.<BR>These are just what I could think of right away.<BR>Yes if distributor spins timing chain is good.<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 08-26-2000).]||||reg||1
